      "line": 113,
      "observation": "validateTokenExpiry rejects absent expiry and expiry at or before the current application clock before creating authenticated token state.",
      "limit": "This traces rejection of expired personal access tokens only. Roles permitted to set expiry (.1), other security attributes and trusted time remain open.",
